Decision 37, clean: DECISIONS 385, CODEGEN.md §4.2: gen/go holds a list of optional elements as rt.List[*T], wherever it is written (a field, a constant), writing a present scalar through rt.Ptr.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A row.
record Row {
  /// The cells.
  cells: [Int?]
}

/// Some cells.
const some = [1, none]

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a" }
-- a.some.json --
[1, null]
-- findings.txt --
0 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
